<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>God so loved the world that He gave us His Son.</l><l>Just believe in Him. Be not perishing,</l><l>But have eternal life.</l><l>Just believe in Him. Be not perishing,</l><l>But have eternal life.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
